          "abridged": false,
          "author": "Joe Vitale",
          "description": "Calling all astronauts, aliens and space rangers…let’s soar to new galaxies! Explore the uncharted planet “Torra 2” with Yolan and her homemade space drone. Zoom with Zila to Gax to find out if the most mysterious planet in the galaxy is also the friendliest! Help Zoomo find his tentacled stuffie, Mr. Fuzzy, cheer on the fastest space racers in the Nebula Grand Prix, and navigate wormholes with Dash to safely return home on planet Flerzoid!   Power up those engines and prepare for liftoff! Adventure begins in 5…4…3…2…  \n\nWritten by Joe Vitale  ",
